# **🟦 Free Services (Free Tier)**

Azure offers **55+ services** with a free tier.
Examples include:

* API Management (developer tier)
* App Configuration
* Azure Functions
* Storage (limited free GB)
* VMs (small B1S VM in some regions)

These allow experimentation without cost.

